1
00:00:22,810 --> 00:00:26,694
♪The night wind shakes off
the withered leaves♪

2
00:00:29,094 --> 00:00:33,709
♪I open the window and gaze at the moon♪

3
00:00:35,582 --> 00:00:40,720
♪Haze spreads across the river,
lanterns drifting♪

4
00:00:42,058 --> 00:00:47,067
♪I hear the memories rustling♪

5
00:00:48,278 --> 00:00:51,199
♪Garden flowers shed petals one by one♪

6
00:00:51,410 --> 00:00:54,501
♪Candlelight flickers,
swaying with melancholy♪

7
00:00:54,798 --> 00:00:59,033
♪I sigh by the lamp over the long night♪

8
00:01:01,018 --> 00:01:03,926
♪Past memories unfold scene by scene♪

9
00:01:04,224 --> 00:01:07,110
♪It's all your face♪

10
00:01:07,420 --> 00:01:12,202
♪Boldly trampling over my heart♪

11
00:01:12,202 --> 00:01:16,782
♪Two measures of ink I take,
one for love miswritten♪

12
00:01:16,782 --> 00:01:18,781
♪And another for youth passed♪

13
00:01:18,984 --> 00:01:24,766
♪With endless sorrow,
I once traced your silhouette♪

14
00:01:25,150 --> 00:01:29,461
♪Two measures of ink I take,
one for joy and sorrow♪

15
00:01:29,461 --> 00:01:31,969
♪And another for parting and reunion♪

16
00:01:32,215 --> 00:01:42,432
♪I write until splendor fades,
and I am no more♪

17
00:01:45,882 --> 00:01:48,716
=Prelude of the White Snake=

18
00:01:48,716 --> 00:01:51,634
=Episode 21=

19
00:01:54,519 --> 00:01:55,519
Let's go.

20
00:02:17,599 --> 00:02:18,599
Did I say I forgive you?

21
00:02:18,840 --> 00:02:19,840
Now you're leaving?

22
00:02:41,159 --> 00:02:42,680
Weren't you using me for the trial?

23
00:02:47,199 --> 00:02:48,280
If you leave like this,

24
00:02:49,520 --> 00:02:51,039
how do I avenge my parents?

25
00:02:53,000 --> 00:02:54,479
Have you found your evil self?

26
00:02:55,919 --> 00:02:58,240
What if that evil demon
comes back for revenge?

27
00:03:02,599 --> 00:03:04,120
What if she doesn't find you

28
00:03:05,039 --> 00:03:06,680
and harms the townspeople instead?

29
00:03:12,039 --> 00:03:13,680
Since you need me for your trial,

30
00:03:14,560 --> 00:03:16,000
then I'll use you once too.

31
00:03:18,680 --> 00:03:20,479
I need to find your evil self

32
00:03:21,240 --> 00:03:22,680
and catch the evil demon behind her.

33
00:03:23,439 --> 00:03:24,879
Since she found you once,

34
00:03:25,159 --> 00:03:26,520
she can find you again.

35
00:03:27,120 --> 00:03:31,560
So I need you by my side
every single moment.

36
00:03:32,439 --> 00:03:33,520
Without my permission,

37
00:03:34,400 --> 00:03:36,199
you can't take one step away from me.

38
00:03:55,280 --> 00:03:57,280
This all started because of you.

39
00:03:58,520 --> 00:04:00,000
Shouldn't you see it through?

40
00:04:01,639 --> 00:04:04,960
What if that evil demon
returns to do harm?

41
00:04:09,000 --> 00:04:12,879
Can you really bear
to abandon everyone in the city?

42
00:04:14,879 --> 00:04:18,079
Can you really bear
to walk away like this?

43
00:04:20,879 --> 00:04:21,879
Will you

44
00:04:26,199 --> 00:04:27,519
pass your love trial or not?

45
00:04:33,854 --> 00:04:38,295
♪Clumsy and new, we gave our first kiss♪

46
00:04:40,491 --> 00:04:45,221
♪Never thought passionate eyes
would turn cold♪

47
00:04:46,433 --> 00:04:52,546
♪I thought of pulling away,
but I'd barely begun♪

48
00:04:53,209 --> 00:04:58,991
♪Having loved you so deep,
how could I love another♪

49
00:04:58,991 --> 00:05:05,254
♪Even if we're strangers again,
why deny we loved♪

50
00:05:05,564 --> 00:05:11,923
♪Though I'm stubborn,
I never stopped you from loving others♪

51
00:05:12,094 --> 00:05:19,461
♪I shouldn't have been so foolish
to think there was still hope♪

52
00:05:19,648 --> 00:05:25,293
♪But you won't even admit what we had♪

53
00:05:25,632 --> 00:05:31,994
♪Even if we're strangers again,
why deny we loved♪

54
00:05:32,128 --> 00:05:39,077
♪Though I have questions,
I never questioned you♪

55
00:05:39,936 --> 00:05:45,727
♪I'll lock you away and set myself free♪

56
00:05:46,384 --> 00:05:50,969
♪After all, I'm the one you deny♪

57
00:05:51,648 --> 00:05:54,322
♪Having ever loved♪

58
00:06:11,480 --> 00:06:13,720
Are you still angry with me?

59
00:06:22,480 --> 00:06:23,839
I get cold in the winter.

60
00:06:24,480 --> 00:06:25,759
Will you hold me?

61
00:06:29,279 --> 00:06:30,279
I will.

62
00:06:31,839 --> 00:06:34,120
And I get hot in the summer.

63
00:06:34,360 --> 00:06:35,800
Do you have a bamboo mat at home?

64
00:06:38,120 --> 00:06:39,120
Yes.

65
00:06:40,600 --> 00:06:41,639
I like spicy food.

66
00:06:41,639 --> 00:06:42,680
Do you like it?

67
00:06:47,560 --> 00:06:48,560
I can accept it.

68
00:06:58,079 --> 00:06:59,360
If you accidentally bite me,

69
00:07:00,040 --> 00:07:01,040
will I be poisoned?

70
00:07:02,519 --> 00:07:03,839
I'm not venomous.

71
00:07:06,480 --> 00:07:07,480
I'm not.

72
00:07:12,720 --> 00:07:16,319
Actually, I would quite like to see you
swallow a piglet whole.

73
00:07:16,839 --> 00:07:18,120
What?

74
00:07:18,720 --> 00:07:20,120
Swallow a piglet whole?

75
00:07:20,839 --> 00:07:21,839
I can't do that.

76
00:07:23,639 --> 00:07:27,959
But I can swallow Xu Xian whole for you.

77
00:07:28,600 --> 00:07:29,600
Want to see that?

78
00:07:30,519 --> 00:07:31,839
You'd better swallow the piglet.

79
00:07:31,839 --> 00:07:33,160
No, I'll swallow you.

80
00:07:33,160 --> 00:07:34,920
- The piglet.
- No.

81
00:07:41,879 --> 00:07:45,040
So it was Bai Suzhen's evil self

82
00:07:45,279 --> 00:07:49,120
who instigated Changming
to slaughter the Rakshasa Bird clan

83
00:07:49,639 --> 00:07:52,279
and used the mural world
to absorb demonic energy,

84
00:07:52,879 --> 00:07:56,279
causing all of this, right?

85
00:08:02,399 --> 00:08:06,000
So you lied to me before?

86
00:08:06,639 --> 00:08:07,680
No, Master.

87
00:08:07,680 --> 00:08:09,759
Bai Suzhen and her sister
are actually good demons.

88
00:08:09,959 --> 00:08:11,199
They came to repay a kindness.

89
00:08:11,879 --> 00:08:13,240
They haven't harmed any mortals.

90
00:08:14,240 --> 00:08:16,839
I never said I would capture them.

91
00:08:18,720 --> 00:08:19,720
Thank you, Master.

92
00:08:20,319 --> 00:08:21,319
Fahai,

93
00:08:22,000 --> 00:08:23,360
I looked into your mind.

94
00:08:23,839 --> 00:08:28,560
Did you set up
the barrier array backward?

95
00:08:30,600 --> 00:08:33,240
Master, actually,
my trip down the mountain...

96
00:08:37,320 --> 00:08:39,159
It was complicated.
It's hard to explain.

97
00:08:39,679 --> 00:08:42,000
You haven't been led
by the nose, have you?

98
00:08:47,960 --> 00:08:49,639
What a disgrace to our sect!

99
00:08:50,600 --> 00:08:53,279
Is the heavens trying
to doom Jinshan Temple?

100
00:08:54,080 --> 00:08:56,559
But Master, I'm just a lay disciple.

101
00:08:57,159 --> 00:09:02,360
Then why do you think
I favor you so much?

102
00:09:04,720 --> 00:09:06,919
Definitely not because of my good looks.

103
00:09:08,799 --> 00:09:10,360
Among all my disciples,

104
00:09:10,759 --> 00:09:12,960
you have the purest and kindest nature,

105
00:09:13,360 --> 00:09:16,919
and you're the most likely
to inherit my mantle.

106
00:09:18,519 --> 00:09:19,919
Then hurry and ordain me, Master.

107
00:09:20,799 --> 00:09:24,759
Let me tell you a story first.

108
00:09:36,440 --> 00:09:38,039
Your evil self failed this time,

109
00:09:38,440 --> 00:09:39,440
so she'll come back.

110
00:09:45,240 --> 00:09:46,720
If our guess is right,

111
00:09:46,960 --> 00:09:49,000
she'll definitely make another move.

112
00:09:50,080 --> 00:09:51,080
We must be careful.

113
00:10:02,919 --> 00:10:04,240
With you leaning on me,

114
00:10:04,240 --> 00:10:06,159
I can't focus on drawing talismans.

115
00:10:12,000 --> 00:10:13,559
Are you even listening to me?

116
00:10:15,000 --> 00:10:16,399
I am.

117
00:10:17,200 --> 00:10:18,960
This is a matter
of life and death for you.

118
00:10:19,240 --> 00:10:20,360
Can you take it seriously?

119
00:10:23,159 --> 00:10:24,720
You're so harsh.

120
00:10:25,519 --> 00:10:29,879
I just want to cling to you
a bit longer.

121
00:10:35,960 --> 00:10:36,960
I'm done drawing.

122
00:10:37,480 --> 00:10:39,799
Really? Then play with me for a while.

123
00:10:42,159 --> 00:10:43,159
You draw.

124
00:10:48,519 --> 00:10:50,440
Qing is back. I'll go check on her.

125
00:10:50,440 --> 00:10:51,440
Come back.

126
00:11:00,360 --> 00:11:01,600
I'm suddenly thirsty.

127
00:11:01,679 --> 00:11:02,679
I'll go get some water.

128
00:11:02,679 --> 00:11:03,679
I'll get it for you.

129
00:11:04,360 --> 00:11:05,360
I'm hungry.

130
00:11:05,360 --> 00:11:06,360
I'll cook for you.

131
00:11:11,879 --> 00:11:13,000
I'm feeling dizzy.

132
00:11:13,279 --> 00:11:14,440
I'll go rest.

133
00:11:14,440 --> 00:11:15,840
Let me massage your temples.

134
00:11:22,600 --> 00:11:25,440
The Drake Demon King
is a thousand-year-old high demon

135
00:11:25,440 --> 00:11:26,679
with immense demonic energy.

136
00:11:27,279 --> 00:11:30,759
Back then, to seal him
in the forbidden grounds,

137
00:11:31,279 --> 00:11:33,200
our founder exhausted
a century of cultivation

138
00:11:33,600 --> 00:11:35,480
and passed away right here.

139
00:11:36,600 --> 00:11:39,600
Master, I don't want you to die.

140
00:11:39,600 --> 00:11:41,200
When did I say I was going to die?

141
00:11:41,440 --> 00:11:42,480
But if he breaks out,

142
00:11:42,759 --> 00:11:44,000
won't you die?

143
00:11:44,639 --> 00:11:45,759
As long as I live,

144
00:11:46,080 --> 00:11:48,200
the sealing spell won't break.

145
00:11:48,399 --> 00:11:50,120
And as long as the seal holds,

146
00:11:50,279 --> 00:11:52,759
I won't die.

147
00:11:57,360 --> 00:11:58,840
That's a relief.

148
00:12:00,159 --> 00:12:01,159
Master,

149
00:12:02,039 --> 00:12:04,639
the one Bai Suzhen encountered
during the tribulation then

150
00:12:05,000 --> 00:12:06,639
was the Drake Demon King, right?

151
00:12:07,159 --> 00:12:09,559
Based on your analysis,

152
00:12:10,240 --> 00:12:11,720
yes.

153
00:12:24,759 --> 00:12:25,799
If Xu Xian finds out,

154
00:12:26,240 --> 00:12:27,759
he'll come to the temple to kill him.

155
00:12:27,759 --> 00:12:29,080
Tell Xu Xian this:

156
00:12:29,240 --> 00:12:31,960
If the Drake Demon King
were easy to kill,

157
00:12:31,960 --> 00:12:33,720
why would we seal him away instead?

158
00:12:35,360 --> 00:12:36,360
Understood, Master.

159
00:12:37,360 --> 00:12:40,279
Also, remind the White Snake
and the Green Snake

160
00:12:40,600 --> 00:12:42,919
not to reveal their true forms at will

161
00:12:42,919 --> 00:12:44,879
or use their spiritual power recklessly.

162
00:12:45,480 --> 00:12:47,200
If they keep using
spiritual power at will,

163
00:12:47,519 --> 00:12:50,000
bringing on rain
and making my back ache,

164
00:12:50,399 --> 00:12:52,159
I will go and capture them myself.

165
00:12:52,200 --> 00:12:54,200
Master, calm down.

166
00:12:54,679 --> 00:12:56,399
Amitabha.

167
00:12:58,639 --> 00:13:00,080
Thank you for your leniency.

168
00:13:00,399 --> 00:13:03,440
I'm only letting it slide
because an immortal guided them.

169
00:13:03,799 --> 00:13:05,000
Otherwise, I...

170
00:13:06,039 --> 00:13:07,279
Don't be angry, Master.

171
00:13:07,559 --> 00:13:10,360
Let me rub your shoulders.

172
00:13:13,759 --> 00:13:14,799
Clumsy.

173
00:13:15,720 --> 00:13:18,679
Not my shoulders, my back.

174
00:13:22,279 --> 00:13:24,120
Go warn them quickly.

175
00:13:24,480 --> 00:13:27,799
I'm worried that the evil self
might attack them at any moment.

176
00:13:28,639 --> 00:13:29,759
A bit to the right.

177
00:13:32,879 --> 00:13:35,159
Well, Master...

178
00:13:35,159 --> 00:13:36,840
What else?

179
00:13:37,519 --> 00:13:39,919
Could you help break the contract?

180
00:13:40,480 --> 00:13:41,919
You made this mess,

181
00:13:42,360 --> 00:13:44,080
so break it yourself.

182
00:13:44,240 --> 00:13:47,240
Master, you're leaving me
totally helpless.

183
00:13:47,399 --> 00:13:48,399
I'm leaving you helpless?

184
00:13:48,440 --> 00:13:49,440
Did I teach you that?

185
00:13:53,720 --> 00:13:55,480
I can break it for you,

186
00:13:56,399 --> 00:14:00,159
but you must promise me one thing.

187
00:14:00,159 --> 00:14:01,159
Name it, Master.

188
00:14:01,960 --> 00:14:03,519
Without a letter from me,

189
00:14:04,200 --> 00:14:06,639
you are not to return to Jinshan Temple.

190
00:14:08,440 --> 00:14:10,399
Why? Jinshan Temple is my home.

191
00:14:10,840 --> 00:14:11,879
Come sit down.

192
00:14:12,279 --> 00:14:14,759
I will impart the teachings to you.

193
00:14:17,639 --> 00:14:18,840
Won't you break the contract?

194
00:14:18,840 --> 00:14:19,840
What teachings?

195
00:14:20,000 --> 00:14:21,440
Whatever it is, come over first.

196
00:14:22,480 --> 00:14:23,639
Hurry up.

197
00:14:36,120 --> 00:14:37,440
You're too far.

198
00:14:50,679 --> 00:14:51,919
Here, drink some water.

199
00:14:53,679 --> 00:14:54,679
I'll guide your hand.

200
00:15:07,120 --> 00:15:08,600
Suzhen, where did Fahai go?

201
00:15:21,120 --> 00:15:22,320
What are you two doing?

202
00:15:23,320 --> 00:15:24,720
Why is the mood so weird?

203
00:15:25,360 --> 00:15:28,440
Qing, Suzhen is learning
to draw talismans.

204
00:15:28,879 --> 00:15:29,879
Talismans?

205
00:15:31,679 --> 00:15:32,879
Is this what you drew?

206
00:15:32,879 --> 00:15:34,279
Qing, don't touch it.

207
00:15:34,279 --> 00:15:36,159
I drew this Tiangang talisman
with great care.

208
00:15:37,360 --> 00:15:39,519
Alright, with great care.

209
00:15:41,159 --> 00:15:44,039
So is this for attack or defense?

210
00:15:51,840 --> 00:15:52,840
An explosive one.

211
00:15:53,559 --> 00:15:54,840
Why didn't you say so earlier?

212
00:15:55,360 --> 00:15:56,679
You didn't ask earlier.

213
00:15:58,679 --> 00:16:00,879
Y-You're mocking me.

214
00:16:03,120 --> 00:16:04,679
That's for laughing at my talismans.

215
00:16:10,279 --> 00:16:11,320
My lord,

216
00:16:11,320 --> 00:16:13,440
I just found out some crucial news.

217
00:16:18,480 --> 00:16:19,600
What is it?

218
00:16:49,020 --> 00:16:53,179
♪I also gave my youth to someone♪

219
00:16:55,646 --> 00:17:00,024
♪I must admit, you made the journey♪

220
00:17:01,567 --> 00:17:07,392
♪When loving you
became instinct, what's left♪

221
00:17:08,161 --> 00:17:12,628
♪Seals a fate too brutal to amend♪

222
00:17:15,493 --> 00:17:19,934
♪Clumsy and new, we gave our first kiss♪

223
00:17:22,130 --> 00:17:26,860
♪Never thought passionate eyes
would turn cold♪

224
00:17:28,072 --> 00:17:34,185
♪I thought of pulling away,
but I'd barely begun♪

225
00:17:34,848 --> 00:17:40,630
♪Having loved you so deep,
how could I love another♪

226
00:17:40,630 --> 00:17:46,893
♪Even if we're strangers again,
why deny we loved♪

227
00:17:47,203 --> 00:17:53,562
♪Though I'm stubborn,
I never stopped you from loving others♪

228
00:17:53,733 --> 00:18:01,100
♪I shouldn't have been so foolish
to think there was still hope♪

229
00:18:01,385 --> 00:18:06,932
♪But you won't even admit what we had♪

230
00:18:07,423 --> 00:18:13,633
♪Even if we're strangers again,
why deny we loved♪

231
00:18:13,943 --> 00:18:20,716
♪Though I have questions,
I never questioned you♪

232
00:18:21,713 --> 00:18:27,366
♪I'll lock you away and set myself free♪

233
00:18:28,200 --> 00:18:32,608
♪After all, I'm the one you deny♪

234
00:18:33,373 --> 00:18:35,961
♪Having ever loved♪
